  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The three kings come from Wang clan. When Wu clan wipes that clan out, three children escape: two males and one female. The female, then six years old, becomes King Xin. Entry into her share of the three kings inheritance on San Cha Mountain requires paper crane Gu for the blue light pillar.",
      "chapters": [
        324
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wang_clan",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "gu_paper_crane_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After nearly a hundred years of cultivation drawn from a rank six Gu Immortal inheritance, she reaches rank five with King Quan and King Bao. In the three-day destruction of Wu clan she moves like a spectre and kills the higher-ups, leaving the village without leaders. Later talk credits her skill at refining Gu, and a unique set built from common rank two paper crane Gu, with finding the security loophole that lets the three kings strike.",
      "chapters": [
        324
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_king_quan",
        "char_king_bao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes her appearance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After failing to advance to rank six, the three kings set up their inheritances in the Gu Immortal blessed land before their deaths.",
      "chapters": [
        346
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the three kings, King Xin is a refinement path Gu Master, and her inheritance is built to choose inheritors of that path.",
      "chapters": [
        347
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "path-label",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the peaks the blue light pillar is named as King Xin’s inheritance beside the yellow and red pillars of the other two kings, and the blue pillar is said to have a demonic charm.",
      "chapters": [
        356
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blue-pillar-at-the-peaks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_king_xin_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan tells Feng Tian Yu that King Xin inheritance has an undefeated hundred battles Gu and orders him to bring it.",
      "chapters": [
        387
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-prizes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_feng_tian_yu",
        "gu_undefeated_hundred_battles_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo Wu Tian names King Xin as Wang Xiao Ya and says her inheritance has divulge information Gu and undefeated hundred battles Gu as part of the essence of the three kings inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        391
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
